                  "value": "Flood disaster; Ahr Valley flood 2021; older adults; aging populations; mental health; social health; disaster recovery; vulnerability; resilience; social vulnerability; climate change adaptation; disaster risk reduction; psychosocial wellbeing; mixed-methods research; Germany; post-disaster recovery; community resilience; health and social care; Pressure and Release (PAR) model; disaster impacts."
